# This repository contains evidence whose SHA-256 values bind exact bytes.
# Disable Git EOL normalization for every path so checkout/staging cannot
# silently rewrite the v1.0.2 baseline (which already includes a small number
# of mixed-EOL files whose exact bytes are pinned). .editorconfig asks editors
# to use LF for newly created or deliberately rewritten text.
* -text

# Preserve human-readable diffs without enabling EOL conversion.
*.md diff
*.txt diff
*.py diff
*.ps1 diff
*.sh diff
*.json diff
*.jsonl diff
*.yml diff
*.yaml diff
*.toml diff
*.lock diff
